[0.000, "o", "\r\n  \u001b[0;32m\u001b[1m  PASS\u001b[0m (HTTP 400 matched expected 400)\r\n\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[0;34m------------------------------------------------------------\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1mTest 2: Reject registration with weak password (Register - Weak Password)\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[0;34m------------------------------------------------------------\u001b[0m\r\n"]
